# Build and test artefacts (CLAUDE.md, Build: binaries always carry an extension)
*.bin
*.exe
*.test
*.out
coverage.*
!compiler/testdata/coverage.tsv
profile.cov
tools/bin/

# A pinned Go toolchain fetched by "make toolchain"; 70 MB of someone else's build
.go/

# The 3GPP archives tools/corpus/extract.py downloads. It re-fetches them and
# "--clean" removes them, and the .asn1 modules extracted out of them are
# committed under testdata/3gpp/ - so the archives are a build artefact, not a
# source, and 38MB of them does not belong in history.
tools/corpus/downloads/

# Intel SDE, fetched by .tools/cmd/sde. The pin and the checksum live in the
# program. The kit is about 37MB and is not source.
.tools/cmd/sde/downloads/
.tools/cmd/sde/kit/

# From the make_repo kit
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.coverprofile
go.work
go.work.sum
.env
